      },
      "message": "fix(import): review fixes for the STEP length unit (#3166)\n\n- cadmpeg_import (the #[cfg(unix)] module): pass the new units\n  argument to load_open_within, so the test target builds on Linux and\n  macOS.\n- The unit chosen at the prompt is taken by the next import start,\n  whatever its file: it never waits for a later import of the same\n  file. Pinned by a_chosen_unit_never_waits_for_a_later_import_of_the_\n  same_file.\n- Troubleshooting: the answer is not kept; the next import, a linked\n  file's re-import included, asks again.\n\nRefs #1874\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
